      "body": "### The problem\n\nAs I work through the migration to enums (`SensorStateClass`, `***DeviceClass`, `EntityCategory`) I sometimes spot integrations that would benefit from using `_attr_***`.\n\nHere is a list for tracking:\n- [x] [hvv_departures](https://github.com/home-assistant/core/tree/dev/homeassistant/components/hvv_departures)\n- [x] [iaqualink](https://github.com/home-assistant/core/tree/dev/homeassistant/components/iaqualink) #100281\n- [x] [icloud](https://github.com/home-assistant/core/tree/dev/homeassistant/components/icloud) #99390\n- [x] [ihc](https://github.com/home-assistant/core/tree/dev/homeassistant/components/ihc)\n- [x] [insteon](https://github.com/home-assistant/core/tree/dev/homeassistant/components/insteon)\n- [ ] [integration](https://github.com/home-assistant/core/tree/dev/homeassistant/components/integration)\n- [x] [islamic_prayer_times](https://github.com/home-assistant/core/tree/dev/homeassistant/components/islamic_prayer_times)\n",
